    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d744">

                <pb facs="0706" n="698" xml:id="pg698"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.248/194</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-11-28">November 28, 1940</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Dr. Soong came in at his request. He desired to follow up his application for a
                    loan and for more airplanes, by handing to me a confidential communication,
                    unsigned, from Chiang Kai-shek, to be transmitted to the President (copy
                        attached),<anchor n="13" xml:id="d744-f1"/> I shall today hand it to the
                    President.</p>
                <closer><signed>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ordell</hi>] H[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ull</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
